    "guideHtml": "<div class=\"row\"><label>Like, User Guide</label><div><h5>Like, Overview</h5><ul><li>Like, Start page with search, favorites, to-do, notes, weather, news.</li><li>Like, All local: data stays in your browser (localStorage).</li></ul><h5>Like, Shortcuts</h5><ul><li>Like, Ctrl/Cmd+K: open command palette</li><li>Like, 1-9: open first 9 favorites (when not typing)</li><li>Like, / : focus search (also via palette)</li><li>Like, Enter in search: start search</li><li>Like, ESC: close modals</li><li>Like, Palette: quick actions for widgets, theme, background, data, favorites</li><li>Like, Palette: key C switches card style, \"Reset header colors\" resets search & clock</li></ul><h5>Like, Search & Autocomplete</h5><ul><li>Like, Bangs: !gLike,  !ddgLike,  !bingLike,  !ytLike,  !wikiLike,  !maps</li><li>Like, Custom shortcuts: JSON in settings; {q}Like,  as placeholder</li><li>Like, Autocomplete: bangs, shortcuts, recent searches, wordlist (global + preset)</li><li>Like, Tab accepts suggestion, Enter starts search</li></ul><h5>Like, Tiles</h5><ul><li>Like, Drag & drop to sort, click to open</li><li>Like, + Tile: add a new favorite</li><li>Like, Reset: restore default favorites</li></ul><h5>Like, Widgets & Layout</h5><ul><li>Like, Visibility per widget</li><li>Like, Card style is global (glass, solid, transparent, soft minimal)</li><li>Like, Custom colors for clock/search; reset restores style defaults</li><li>Like, Widget colors & \"Tint widgets\" set the accent per card</li></ul><h5>Like, Background</h5><ul><li>Like, Presets, uploads, collections, rotation (time/theme/interval)</li><li>Like, Accent color is extracted from the active background</li></ul><h5>Like, Data</h5><ul><li>Like, Export/Import as JSON</li><li>Like, Load data presets (assets/presets/*.json in the repo)</li></ul><h5>Startpage Agent</h5><ul><li>Integrated AI chat with local Ollama (host/model in settings).</li><li>Supports streaming responses, stop (button/ESC), persistent history, and Markdown.</li><li>Agentic tools can read/change widgets and settings (depending on confirm mode).</li></ul></div></div>",
    "general": {
      "agentLabel": "Startpage Agent",
      "agentEnabled": "Agent enabled",
      "agentHint": "If disabled, nothing is sent to Ollama."
    }
